| `comments explain code` | A comment that opens by reporting a change (`# now uses X`) fails `tests/integration/test_change_comment_gate.py`, because the commit message carries the change and the comment owes the reason. | `make test` | [`change_comments.phrases`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | A heuristic: it cannot see a phrase in mid-sentence or a change reported in other words. | [python-style.md](../guides/python-style.md) | always |
